    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d119">

                <pb facs="0226" n="146" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg146"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Plaza to
                        the Vice-President of the United
                    States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito, Ecuador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Ecuadorian people and Government join in the legitimate sor row of the Great
                    Republic for the demise of its illustrious President.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Plaza</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >President.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
